Subject: [PATCH] Settings: NFC auto turn-off timeout

UI for services NfcAutoOff (NFC_OFF_TIMEOUT), modelled on AXP BluetoothTimeoutPreferenceController. Replaces GrapheneOS bf67e682b, which targets the newer ExtSettings framework.

Change-Id: I373ff60794b0248855ae547f9e5b22b3b12829c1
---
